  "dataUri" : "https://data.texas.gov/resource/3qmf-seku",
  "description" : "To view the full data set please click the Export link above. This data set contains debt outstanding for local government Issuers, including cities, community college districts, counties, hospital districts, independent school districts, other special districts and water districts by issuance. Tax-supported GO debt includes debt secured by a combination of ad valorem taxes and other revenue sources. Not included are obligations of less than one-year maturity and special obligations not requiring Attorney General Approval. Excludes conduit debt. Data includes pledge, total principal, total interest and total debt service.",
